			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732561201,
					"content": "As I thought. The problem lies with these relays. The energy from the Energy Cores isn't reaching them. We need to find a way to connect them...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732561202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732561202,
					"content": "And some of the relays in this place have been sealed in crystal... But since these ruins don't use impurities as an energy source, they shouldn't have come to the attention of Khvarena at all...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732561203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732561203,
					"content": "The only explanation for that has to be that this place was intentionally sealed by someone with the ability to use Khvarena. But why would they do that? What are they trying to hide?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732561204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732561204,
					"content": "Well, I suppose this can be discussed later. Our current task is still to use Khvarena's power to remove the Gray Crystals that have formed those seals.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732561205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732561205,
					"content": "There should be Farrwicks nearby that contain Khvarena's power. I believe you can sense it too, mighty Envoy?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732561206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732561206,
					"content": "Umm... Hmph. Of course! Are you doubting my majestic power as the Bloomguard?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732561207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sorush"
				},
				{
					"id": 732561207,
					"content": "Hardly, I would never dare! Please, great and eminent Envoy, guide us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732561208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732561208,
					"content": "We just need to find the Farrwicks, remove the Gray Crystals, and then use the mixer once again to connect these relays.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				}
			]
		},
