				{
					"id": 732562305,
					"content": "The copied Dahrian records in my notes say that this place was once modified for use as fortifications from which the monsters could be attacked, although it didn't see much use in that regard.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562306,
					"content": "Strange, isn't it? Why would the Dahrians, who triggered the defiling disaster, create machines to fight monsters?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562307,
					"content": "All the same, now that we have activated the control systems for these ruins, the defensive mechanisms within the proving ground must also have been activated.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562308,
					"content": "The Great Song we are searching for should be within that Golem. Though I am stymied, I suspect that it will prove easy for you all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562309,
					"content": "Please allow me to stay here and await your return, so that we may be able to obtain all the Great Songs of Khvarena.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562310,
					"content": "Well, you are indeed but a mere human. Such a request is to be expected.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sorush"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562311,
					"content": "By your gracious leave, then.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562312,
					"content": "Well, guess Nasejuna's slipping off at the last moment. Still, Paimon's a lot happier now that the two of you won't be bouncing off each other for a while...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7325624,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7325624
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7325624",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7325624,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Nasejuna",
					"Sorush"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732562401,
					"content": "Ah, as one might expect of the great Envoy and her Yasnapati. Neither the Dahrian machines nor the creatures of Dev were able to stop you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562402,
					"content": "Eh? When did you get in here, Nasejuna?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562403,
					"content": "Why, I was watching your wondrous battles from the side, and oh, what a sight it was! Then, upon seeing that you had the Great Song in hand, I rushed to meet with you, of course!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562404,
					"content": "Good work, all of you. And while we're on this topic, perhaps you might give the Great Songs of Khvarena to me for safekeeping? I mean, well, it might... How should I say this... give me a greater sense of my participation in our grand endeavor?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562405,
					"content": "But you didn't do all that much from the start, and anyway, Zurvan said that we shouldn't give the Great Songs of Khvarena away carelessly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562406,
					"content": "Oh, don't say that. I mean, I have done so much research on them! I'm sure that a little examination on my part will be of help later!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562407,
					"content": "For example, we could find out why these Great Songs of Khvarena have come to be hidden in these ruins, and...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562408,
					"content": "This is not the time for stories, Nasuraia.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sorush"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562409,
					"content": "That's right! We need to go to the next place where we can find a Great Khvarena, don't we?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562410,
					"content": "You can tell us your stories again once we've gotten them all, Nasejuna.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732562411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732562411,
					"content": "Well... alright.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nasejuna"
				}
			]
		},
		{
